{"headword":"גָּבַהּ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. be high, exalted (</strong>NH <em>id.</em> (Hiph.), Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבַהּ</span>, cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جَبْهَةٌ</span> <em>forehead</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">جَبَةٌ</span> <em>prominence of forehead;</em> compare perhaps also Assyrian <em>gabâni</em>, <em>heights</em> (?) Lotz<sup>TP 133</sup><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.16\">2 Ch 26:16</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּֽבְהָא֯</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.5\">Ez 31:5</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">א</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">ה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבַהְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.10\">Ez 31:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּֽבְהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 35:5\" href=\"/Job.35.5\">Jb 35:5</a> + 3 times; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְבַּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.12\">Pr 18:12</a> + 5 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְבְּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">Ez 31:14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְבָּ֑הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:7\" href=\"/Job.36.7\">Jb 36:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּגְבָּ֑הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.15\">Je 13:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּגְבְּהֶינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:50\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.50\">Ez 16:50</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּגְבֹהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:11\" href=\"/Psalms.103.11\">ψ 103:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְגָבְהָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:11\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.11\">Zp 3:11</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be high, lofty, tall</em>, e.g. tree <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.11\">Ez 19:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.5\">31:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">14</a>, heavens <a data-ref=\"Job 35:5\" href=\"/Job.35.5\">Jb 35:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.9\">Is 55:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:11\" href=\"/Psalms.103.11\">ψ 103:11</a>, man <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.23\">1 S 10:23</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be exalted</em>, of man in dignity and honour <a data-ref=\"Job 36:7\" href=\"/Job.36.7\">Jb 36:7</a>, of servant of Yahweh <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 52:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.52.13\">Is 52:13</a>, God <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.16\">Is 5:16</a>, God’s ways <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.9\">Is 55:9</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>lofty</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבַהּ לִבּוֹ</span>:—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"in a good sense, <em>encouraged</em> in the ways of Yahweh <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.6\">2 Ch 17:6</a>;"}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"elsewhere in a bad sense, <em>be haughty</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 131:1\" href=\"/Psalms.131.1\">ψ 131:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.12\">Pr 18:12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.16\">2 Ch 26:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.25\">32:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.2\">Ez 28:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.17\">17</a>, and so without <span dir=\"rtl\">לב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.16\">Is 3:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.15\">Je 13:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:50\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.50\">Ez 16:50</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:11\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.11\">Zp 3:11</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִגְבַּהְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.24\">Ez 17:24</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַגְבִּיהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:27\" href=\"/Job.39.27\">Jb 39:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.16\">Je 49:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:4\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.4\">Ob 4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּגְבִּיהֶהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.14\">2 Ch 33:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַגְבִּיהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:7\" href=\"/Job.5.7\">Jb 5:7</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגְבֵּהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.11\">Is 7:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.31\">Ez 21:31</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַגְבִּיהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.19\">Pr 17:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 113:5\" href=\"/Psalms.113.5\">ψ 113:5</a>;—<em>make high, exalt</em>, e.g. trees <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.24\">Ez 17:24</a>, wall <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.14\">2 Ch 33:14</a>, gate <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.19\">Pr 17:19</a>, nest <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.16\">Je 49:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:4\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.4\">Ob 4</a>, dwelling <a data-ref=\"Psalms 113:5\" href=\"/Psalms.113.5\">ψ 113:5</a> a request <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.11\">Is 7:11</a>, the lowly <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.31\">Ez 21:31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַגְבִּיהוּ עוּף</span> <em>make their flight high, soar aloft</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:7\" href=\"/Job.5.7\">Jb 5:7</a>, without <span dir=\"rtl\">עוף</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:27\" href=\"/Job.39.27\">Jb 39:27</a>."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB01586","strong_numbers":["1361"],"next_hw":"גָּבֹהַּ","prev_hw":"גֹּבַי","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["1467"],"TWOT":["305"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}